        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sergeant Władysław Grydziuszko\n- Ships: Tama Maru No. 2\n- Products: Douglas SBD Dauntless, Curtiss SB2C Helldiver\n- Companies: Douglas Aircraft\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- Sergeant Władysław Grydziuszko was a soldier during World War II.\n- Tama Maru No. 2 was damaged during World War II by a Japanese naval scout plane and dive bomber.\n- The Japanese naval scout plane and dive bomber was the Douglas SBD Dauntless.\n- Douglas Aircraft manufactured the Douglas SBD Dauntless.\n- The Curtiss SB2C Helldiver replaced the Douglas SBD Dauntless.",
